OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMetro plans 'cut off my link from
OL,4,Ahome to work'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMetro operator Nexus has suggested
OL,7,Fclosing Hylton Bank to allow the new
OL,8,Fline to continue from the existing
OL,9,Fstation terminus, with plans to either
OL,10,Fre-route traffic via a new road and
OL,11,Ftunnel, or via Claxheugh Road.
OL,13,FIt said the final plan had not been
OL,14,Fdecided and it would "continue to look
OL,15,Fat alternatives".
